Start
Input the number of guests N
Set Hotel Revenue = 0
Repeat the following steps for each guest from 1 to N

Input season
Input room type
Input number of night

If season is Peak:
If room is Standard, set rate = 5000
Else if room is Deluxe, set rate = 8000
Else, set rate = 1200.

Otherwise, if season is Off-Peak:
If room is Standard, set rate = 3000
Else if room is Deluxe, set rate = 5000
Else, set rate = 8000

